\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. PRAISE O praise our God and king !
\par Hymns of adoration sing ;
\par \i 
\par For His mercies still endure ,
\par Ever faithful, ever sure.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\i0\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Praise Him that He made the sun
\par Day by day his course to run :
\par 
\par \i For His mercies still endure ,
\par Ever faithful, ever sure.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. And the silver moon by night,
\par Shinning with her gentle light :
\par 
\par \i For His mercies still endure ,
\par Ever faithful, ever sure.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Praise Him that He gave the rain 
\par To mature the swelling grain :
\par 
\par \i For His mercies still endure ,
\par Ever faithful, ever sure.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. And hath bid the fruitful field 
\par Crops of precious increase yield :
\par 
\par \i For His mercies still endure ,
\par Ever faithful, ever sure.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Praise Him for our harvest store,
\par He hath filled the garner floor ;
\par 
\par \i For His mercies still endure ,
\par Ever faithful, ever sure.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. And for richer food than this,
\par Pledge of everlasting bliss :
\par 
\par \i For His mercies still endure ,
\par Ever faithful, ever sure.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8. Glory to our bounteous King !
\par Glory let creation sing,
\par \i 
\par Glory to the Father, Son, 
\par And blest Spirit, Three in one.  \i0   
\par                                      Amen.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

